/-!
# A204123

Symmetric matrix based on f(i,j)=max([i/j],[j/i]), where [ ]=floor, by antidiagonals.

The 95 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A204123

